WEBVTT

00:22.830 --> 00:27.032
I saw the static in your eyes, the silent

00:27.072 --> 00:31.475
screams, the practiced lies.

00:33.595 --> 00:37.658
A pain, a smile, a hollow shell Trapped inside a

00:37.758 --> 00:40.540
private hell

00:42.082 --> 00:47.106
All I tried, all I tried to warn All that cold and

00:47.126 --> 00:51.129
broken morn You couldn't hear my quiet plea But

00:51.149 --> 00:54.932
you are finally back with me

00:56.213 --> 01:03.138
And I will never let you go again This is a promise

01:03.178 --> 01:10.101
not a warning for when If the darkness ever calls

01:10.141 --> 01:17.905
your name I'll be the fire, I'll be the flame And

01:18.105 --> 01:26.208
if I have to With my own two hands

01:26.849 --> 01:33.437
I'll drag you back from those broken lands

01:33.497 --> 01:37.543
I'll

01:37.603 --> 01:38.163
take

02:04.239 --> 02:07.622
I'll be the flute song in your head for every

02:07.762 --> 02:10.925
single word unsaid

02:14.848 --> 02:18.992
A steady note, a gentle sound on this new and

02:19.092 --> 02:20.173
solid ground

02:24.098 --> 02:28.345
No more silence, no more fear As long as I am

02:28.365 --> 02:32.111
standing here You'll never have to walk alone

02:32.251 --> 02:34.475
I'll bring my broken brother home

02:38.303 --> 02:44.327
I will never let you go again This is a promise,

02:44.427 --> 02:51.431
not a word if or when If the darkness ever calls

02:51.471 --> 02:59.156
your name I'll be the fire, I'll be the flame And

02:59.196 --> 03:07.565
if I have to With my own two hands,

03:08.186 --> 03:14.750
I'll drag you back from those broken lands.

